{"id":"415198","name":"榨菜丝秀珍菇鸭蛋汤","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"","cover":"images/415198/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"秀珍菇","amount":"60克"},{"name":"榨菜丝","amount":"40克"},{"name":"鸭蛋","amount":"1只"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：秀珍菇（已清洗）、榨菜丝、鸭蛋。","img":"images/415198/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将鸭蛋打成蛋液。","img":"images/415198/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将已清洗好的秀珍菇和榨菜丝下入清水锅中煮开煮上2分钟。","img":"images/415198/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"然后，倒入鸭蛋蛋液。","img":"images/415198/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/415198/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"调味搅匀，即成。","img":"images/415198/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}